<title>JAPAN: Toyota Motor leaps to new record high in morning.</title>
<headline>Toyota Motor leaps to new record high in morning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp shares jumped to a new high for the year in early morning trade on Tuesday, as investors continued to buy blue-chip issues, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0022 GMT, the shares were 20 yen higher at 3,270 yen, renewing the lifetime high of 3,250 hit on Monday.</p>
